WEBVTT

00:12:27.716 --> 00:12:30.396
but then there's backlash
if you ask for too many things.

00:12:30.396 --> 00:12:31.556
And so it is hard.

00:12:31.596 --> 00:12:33.956
I think that's part
of what we need to understand.

00:12:33.956 --> 00:12:37.396
The other thing I would say is,
this is also about sponsors and mentors,

00:12:37.396 --> 00:12:39.556
and finding people
that can help you navigate

00:12:39.556 --> 00:12:42.436
and help you understand cultures
and pull you along as well.

00:12:42.436 --> 00:12:44.436
And one of my biggest
challenges used to be

00:12:44.476 --> 00:12:47.236
I didn't see role models
that look like me, I was a first.

00:12:47.276 --> 00:12:49.756
And so I think one of the things
I realized over time

00:12:49.796 --> 00:12:52.876
is I had to pick and choose
from other people that were around me

00:12:52.876 --> 00:12:55.036
to find a leadership style
that worked for me.

00:12:55.076 --> 00:12:58.076
And some of my biggest advocates
were white male leaders

00:12:58.116 --> 00:13:00.556
who I initially thought
I had nothing in common with